cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Dark-Matter-Live, please cite it using this metadata.
title: Dark-Matter-Live
type: software
abstract: >-
  Dark-Matter-Live is a collaborative framework for building and providing
  interactive visualisations of unified constraints on dark-matter models, based
  on published experimental and observational results. It addresses the scaling
  and visualisation challenges of increasingly busy global limit plots by
  supporting reinterpretation and renormalisation of incoming results and
  mapping them onto a consistent, model-aware parameter space.
authors:
